    LLM: 'Game: Vier-Anderle. Logic: See rules.objective and rules.gameplay.',
    Player: 'Vier-Anderle (Strassenwart) is a German Tarock gambling game from the Black Forest. 2-13 players (best 5-8). Uses 38-card Cego pack (tarocks only). 4 cards each. Win at least 1 trick or pay penalty equal to pot. When pot has money: players opt in/out; each trick wins Â¼ of pot; no tricks = pay pot amount.',
    objective: 'Win at least one trick to avoid paying into the pot. When the pot has money, players may opt in or out; each trick won earns a quarter of the pot, and players who took part but won no tricks pay the full pot amount.',
